  "title": {
   "en": "Amber Alert"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "앰버 얼럿"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Tennessee, a hitman for hire, has stayed true to himself and his past, which has left him at the bottom of the ethics ladder. His life is monotonous, but he has no problem with it. That is, until he unintentionally kidnaps a young child with wildly flowing black hair in a stolen car...\n\n*“Put it in your mouth.”*\n\nTake it all the way down your throat. Without shame, dignity, or self-respect, Amber climaxed, naked and exposed under Tennessee’s gaze. But Tennessee's lips were as firmly locked as before. Still, Amber reminded himself that he had never lost a single battle against Tennessee. It may not have been a victory won fair and square, but isn't a loss by submission still a loss?\n\nWhat a cold-hearted man. The victory was mine.\n\n**Original Novel:** [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/3049005297), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/amberalert), [Mr Blue](https://www.mrblue.com/novel/viewcommz0083), [Bookcube](https://www.bookcube.com/detail.asp?series_num=920016600)\n\n[**Original Webtoon**](https://ridibooks.com/books/4928003862)"
  },
